#: includes/class-retreat.php:405
msgid "Your letter for [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames]"
msgstr "A túa carta para [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames]"

#: includes/class-retreat.php:415
msgid ""
"Hello, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for the letter you wrote to [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] for the retreat \"[retreat_name]\".\n"
"\n"
"In the end, [attendant_name] did not attend the retreat. For confidentiality and data protection reasons, we are going to destroy the digital record of your letter and the printed copy that had been prepared to be delivered.\n"
"\n"
"Your letter is attached to this email, so that you can keep it and use it again if [attendant_name] takes part in a retreat in the coming months.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards."
msgstr ""
"Ola, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Grazas pola carta que lle escribiches a [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] para o retiro «[retreat_name]».\n"
"\n"
"Ao final, [attendant_name] non participou no retiro. Por motivos de confidencialidade e de protección de datos, imos destruír o rexistro dixital da túa carta e a copia impresa que se preparara para entregarlla.\n"
"\n"
"Adxuntámosche a túa carta neste correo electrónico para que a conserves e poidas volver usala se [attendant_name] participa nun retiro nos próximos meses.\n"
"\n"
"Un saúdo."

